Here `this.props.onClick(this.props.id)` is executed right away, and its return value (likely `undefined`) is passed as the `onClick` prop. To fix this, wrap the call in an arrow function (or a bound function) so that it runs only on click:

```jsx
<button
  className="btn btn-primary"
